  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_dornick_cb14df57c1e3c3be9c6ff1cc638c0e82e73873d1c0133b8d10800642f4a59c79623">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>cloth manufactured in Doornik/Tournai, especially a silk, worsted, woollen or partly woollen fabric, used for hangings, carpets, vestments etc. (OED s.v. dornick1) | cloth manufactured in Doornik/ Tournai, especially a silk, worsted, woollen or partly woollen fabric, used for hangings, carpets, vestments etc. (OED s.v. dornick1) | (Dornyck, -es) with silke | Note that the Cologne translation describes this product as low-quality tapistry (schlechte decken) | 19,</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
    <crm:P2_has_type rdf:resource="http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object"/>
  </rdf:Description>
